# Player/item interaction, ported from p_inter.c to Flow.
#
# maxammo[] / clipammo[] live here; C shims read them via INFO_maxammo.
# player_t / mobj_t stay C-owned; player fields use PLAYER_*, weaponinfo
# uses WEAPONINFO_* (pspr.flow).
#
# FEATURE_DEHACKED is off — deh_* values are hardcoded defaults, and
# DEH_String is identity (plain string literals).

